    'female|a||Width is the whole point: the widest bar moves the result furthest, so that uncertainty matters most.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    female|a||Ranking and the base case are exactly what it does show; probability is what it withholds.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6760
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    female|a||The probability lives in the parameters of the model, not at the bedside.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5040
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    female|a||Price enters through delta C, which moves the curve sideways rather than flattening it.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5560
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    female|a||A tornado bar is a swing between two chosen values, not a likelihood.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5480
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    female|a||It counts draws, not patients — and it says nothing about the model itself.:
